Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At SecureTech, we are constantly striving to enhance our services and ensure the utmost security for your account. We are excited to share some important updates regarding our security measures that will be implemented over the coming weeks. **Enhanced Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** To better protect your account, we are introducing an enhanced version of our two-factor authentication process. Starting next month, you will have the option to use biometric verification, such as fingerprint or facial recognition, in addition to your standard verification methods. This will provide an additional layer of security and make accessing your account even more convenient. **Security Alerts** In our commitment to keeping you informed, we are launching a new feature that sends real-time security alerts to your registered email or mobile device. You will receive notifications for any unusual activity detected on your account, such as login attempts from unfamiliar locations or devices. We encourage you to review these alerts promptly and report any suspicious activity. **Phishing Awareness Training** As cyber threats continue to evolve, we believe that education is key. We are pleased to offer a complimentary online training session focused on recognizing and avoiding phishing scams. This session will be available on our website starting next week, and we highly recommend that all customers participate to enhance their understanding of online security. **Feedback and Support** Your feedback is invaluable to us